.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt SSH3-SERVER 8
.Os ssh3-go
.Sh NAME
.Nm ssh3-server
.Nd SSH3 server: user sessions and forwards over HTTP/3 (QUIC)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -bind Ar addr:port
.Op Fl c Ar certfile
.Op Fl h Ar keyfile
.Op Fl p Ar port
.Op Fl -url-path Ar path
.Op Fl -enable-password-login Op Cm true | false
.Op Fl -gateway-ports Cm no | yes | clientspecified
.Op Fl -generate-selfsigned-cert
.Op Fl -generate-public-cert Ar domain
.Op Fl -stream-rx-mb Ar mib
.Op Fl -conn-rx-mb Ar mib
.Op Fl -initial-packet-size Ar bytes
.Op Fl -sftp-jail Cm chroot | lexical
.Op Fl -permit-open Ar spec
.Op Fl -permit-listen Ar spec
.Op Fl -max-unauth-conversations Ar n
.Op Fl -max-password-failures Ar n
.Op Fl -password-lockout-seconds Ar s
.Op Fl -max-reverse-forwards Ar n
.Op Fl -max-channels-per-conversation Ar n
.Op Fl -max-sftp-sessions-per-user Ar n
.Op Fl -max-connections Ar n
.Op Fl -max-idle-timeout Ar seconds
.Op Fl -handshake-idle-timeout Ar seconds
.Op Fl -max-incoming-streams Ar n
.Op Fl -max-incoming-uni-streams Ar n
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
speaks the SSH3 protocol: one QUIC (UDP) listener carries an HTTP/3
extended CONNECT to the
.Pa /ssh3-term
route
.Pq Fl -url-path ,
and every subsequent bidirectional stream is an SSH3 channel.
Shell and exec sessions, direct-tcp and direct-udp forwards, the
in-process SFTP and forward-agent bridges ride those channels.
The client CLI is
.Xr ssh3 1 .
.Pp
The daemon runs as root and, after the CONNECT authentication,
drops every session with a resolvable username onto that account
(initgroups, setgid, setuid, the home chdir) before any spawn; a
user without a passwd entry answers 401 at the CONNECT.
Public keys authenticate out of the box: the OpenSSH
.Pa authorized_keys
file or the
.Pa .ssh3/authorized_identities
file of the target account.
Password authentication rides on by default on the amd64 build (the
CGO crypt backend; the Debian package depends on the build that
ships it): the Basic step verifies against the unix accounts, the
brute force stays bounded by the per-account lockout
.Pq Fl -max-password-failures , Fl -password-lockout-seconds
and the unauthenticated conversation cap, and the root account
always refuses the password step
.Pq the PermitRootLogin prohibit-password analog .
Turn it off with
.Fl -enable-password-login=false
or
.Ev SSH3_ENABLE_PASSWORD_LOGIN=0 .
.Pp
Every option below has an
.Ev SSH3_*
environment counterpart (the same name upper-cased), read from the
conffile
.Pa /etc/ssh3/ssh3-server.env
through the systemd
.Cm EnvironmentFile .
.Ss Host keys and certificates
The QUIC handshake needs an X.509 certificate
.Pq Fl c Ar certfile , the default ./cert.pem
and its private key
.Pq Fl h Ar keyfile , the default ./priv.key .
The Debian unit passes
.Pa /etc/ssh3/cert.pem
and
.Pa /etc/ssh3/priv.key ;
a missing pair is generated at install time with the mandatory
IP/DNS subjectAltNames (clients validate the certificate against
the address they dial).
.Fl -generate-selfsigned-cert
writes a self-signed pair to the
.Fl c / Fl h
paths (they must not exist yet);
.Fl -generate-public-cert
produces a public Let's Encrypt certificate for the given domain
(repeated for several domains, reused and renewed automatically
while the server runs).
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -bind Ar addr:port
The QUIC listen address
.Pq default Li [::]:443 .
.It Fl p Ar port
The listen port, the sshd
.Fl p
form: overrides the port part of
.Fl -bind ,
the bind address stays.
.It Fl -url-path Ar path
The HTTP/3 CONNECT route
.Pq default Li /ssh3-term .
.It Fl c Ar certfile , Fl h Ar keyfile
The host certificate and key, the sshd-shaped aliases of
.Fl -cert / Fl -key .
.It Fl -enable-password-login Op Cm true | false
Password authentication against the unix accounts
.Pq default true on the amd64 build .
.It Fl -gateway-ports Cm no | yes | clientspecified
The GatewayPorts policy of the reverse (Fl R) listeners
.Pq the sshd_config semantics , default Cm no :
force loopback binds, allow any bind, or let the client ask.
.It Fl -generate-selfsigned-cert
Generate a self-signed certificate/key pair at the
.Fl c / Fl h
paths and use it.
.It Fl -generate-public-cert Ar domain
Produce and renew a public Let's Encrypt certificate for
.Ar domain .
.It Fl -stream-rx-mb Ar mib , Fl -conn-rx-mb Ar mib
Initial per-stream / per-connection flow control receive windows in
MiB (defaults 8/16).
.It Fl -initial-packet-size Ar bytes
Initial QUIC packet size
.Pq default 1350 .
.It Fl -sftp-jail Cm chroot | lexical
SFTP path isolation: the per-session child chroots into the user's
home
.Pq Cm chroot , the sshd model
or the in-process lexical jail
.Pq Cm lexical .
.It Fl -permit-open Ar spec , Fl -permit-listen Ar spec
The allowed host:port targets of the client-side forwards and the
allowed binds of the reverse listeners
.Pq comma/space separated, Cm * wildcards, Cm ! negates; empty: unrestricted .
.It Fl -max-unauth-conversations Ar n
Conversations sitting unauthenticated before refusals (the
MaxStartups analog).
.It Fl -max-password-failures Ar n , Fl -password-lockout-seconds Ar s
The password brute-force lockout: failures per account and the
lockout duration.
.It Fl -max-reverse-forwards Ar n , Fl -max-channels-per-conversation Ar n , Fl -max-sftp-sessions-per-user Ar n , Fl -max-connections Ar n
Per-user / global resource caps
.Pq 0: no limit .
.It Fl -max-idle-timeout Ar seconds , Fl -handshake-idle-timeout Ar seconds
The QUIC idle and handshake timeouts, the sshd canon
.Pq defaults 24h and 120s: the ClientAliveInterval=0 and
LoginGraceTime shapes .
.It Fl -max-incoming-streams Ar n , Fl -max-incoming-uni-streams Ar n
QUIC transport limits for peer-initiated streams.
.It Fl v , Fl V
Verbose logging; print the software version and exit.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev SSH3_ENABLE_PASSWORD_LOGIN
0/1: the password authentication switch
.Pq default 1 on the amd64 build .
.It Ev SSH3_GATEWAY_PORTS
The GatewayPorts policy
.Pq Cm no | yes | clientspecified .
.It Ev SSH3_LOG_LEVEL , Ev SSH3_LOG_FILE
The log level
.Pq debug | info | warn | error
and the log file (unset: stderr, which under systemd reaches the
journal).
.It Ev SSH3_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN
Seconds to drain the active conversations on SIGTERM before the
close grace
.Pq default 5 .
.It Ev SSH3_PPROF
If set, serve the Go pprof endpoint.
.El
The remaining limits above all read their
.Ev SSH3_*
counterparts
.Pq for example Ev SSH3_MAX_CONNECTIONS , Ev SSH3_PERMIT_OPEN .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/ssh3/cert.pem , Pa /etc/ssh3/priv.key
The host certificate and key pair of the Debian unit (generated at
install time when missing).
.It Pa /etc/ssh3/ssh3-server.env
The conffile read through the unit's
.Cm EnvironmentFile .
.It Pa ~/.ssh/authorized_keys , Pa ~/.ssh3/authorized_identities
The per-account public key chains, the sshd compatibility and the
native form.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ssh3 1 ,
.Xr sshd 8
